<title>USA: Hoke County, N.C., sets May 6 bond referendum.</title>
<headline>Hoke County, N.C., sets May 6 bond referendum.</headline>
<dateline>RAEFORD, N.C. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Carolina's Hoke County will hold a referendum May 6 on $4.5 million of water system improvement bonds, the Fayetteville-Observer Times said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The county commission approved the referendum on Monday. Debt service would be paid with revenues from the water system.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
</text>
